{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu19", "cards": [{"id": "u1.t.family", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">FAM<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">i<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ly<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"family\" data-audio=\"audio/family.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: family\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"family\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Order<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Primates<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Family<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Hominidae<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Genus<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Homo<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A rank below order, made up of related genera.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>科<\/b>：目之下的一级，由亲缘相近的几个属组成。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Family sits just above genus.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">family 紧挨在属的上面。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which rank is just below family?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Genus.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.bacteria", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">bac<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ri<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"Bacteria\" data-audio=\"audio/bacteria.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: Bacteria\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bacteria\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"52\" rx=\"62\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"52\" rx=\"55\" ry=\"23\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M88 50 Q100 38 112 50 Q122 64 104 66 Q88 64 88 50\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cell wall<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"14.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"21.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,21.0 97.8,16.5 102.2,16.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA floats free (no nucleus)<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A domain of single-celled prokaryotes with no nucleus, found almost everywhere.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>细菌域<\/b>：单细胞原核生物组成的域，没有细胞核，几乎无处不在。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">One bacterium, many bacteria.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">单数 bacterium，复数 bacteria。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Do bacteria have a nucleus?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. They are prokaryotes.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.archaea", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ar<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CHAE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"Archaea\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: Archaea\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Archaea\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Looks like<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"8.834586466165414\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bacteria: one cell,<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">no nucleus<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Often lives in<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">hot springs, salt<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">lakes, deep vents<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A domain of single-celled prokaryotes that look like bacteria but are chemically different; many live in extreme places.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>古菌域<\/b>：外形像细菌但化学成分不同的单细胞原核生物，许多生活在极端环境中。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">archae- = ancient. Archaeology = study of ancient things.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">archae- = 古老的。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a place where archaea may live.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Hot springs, very salty lakes or deep-sea vents.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.eukarya", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">eu<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">KAR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">y<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"Eukarya\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: Eukarya\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Eukarya\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"52\" rx=\"76\" ry=\"44\" class=\"f1 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"52\" r=\"20\" class=\"f4 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eukarya: cells have a nucleus<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The domain of organisms whose cells have a nucleus: protists, fungi, plants and animals.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>真核域<\/b>：细胞有细胞核的生物所在的域：原生生物、真菌、植物和动物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">eu- = true, kary- = nucleus. True nucleus.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">eu- = 真，kary- = 核：真核。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Are humans in Bacteria, Archaea or Eukarya?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Eukarya.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.prokaryote", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">KAR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">y<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ote<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"prokaryote\" data-audio=\"audio/prokaryote.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: prokaryote\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"prokaryote\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Prokaryote<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">no nucleus, DNA<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">free in the cell<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eukaryote<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus holds the<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A cell or organism with no nucleus. Its DNA floats free inside the cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>原核生物<\/b>：没有细胞核的细胞或生物，DNA 游离在细胞里。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pro- = before. Before the nucleus evolved.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">pro- = 之前：出现在细胞核之前。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which domains are prokaryotes?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Bacteria and Archaea.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.eukaryote", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">eu<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">KAR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">y<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ote<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"eukaryote\" data-audio=\"audio/eukaryote.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: eukaryote\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"eukaryote\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"66\" rx=\"76\" ry=\"44\" class=\"f1 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"66\" r=\"20\" class=\"f4 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"9\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus holds DNA<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"11.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"44.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,44.0 97.8,39.5 102.2,39.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A cell or organism whose DNA is inside a nucleus.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>真核生物<\/b>：DNA 位于细胞核内的细胞或生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">eu- = true. True nucleus.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">eu- = 真：真正的核。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a eukaryote.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Any plant, animal, fungus or protist (for example, an amoeba).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.autotroph", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">AU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">to<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">troph<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"autotroph\" data-audio=\"audio/autotroph.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: autotroph\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"autotroph\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sunlight<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">+ CO2 +<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.275\" font-size=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Plant<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"66.975\" font-size=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">(autotroph)<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sugar<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">(food)<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that makes its own food, usually using light energy.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>自养生物<\/b>：能自己制造食物的生物，通常利用光能。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">auto- = self, troph = feeding. Self-feeder.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">auto- = 自己，troph = 营养：自己养自己。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is a tree an autotroph or heterotroph?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Autotroph. It makes its own food by photosynthesis.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.heterotroph", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">HET<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">er<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">troph<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"heterotroph\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: heterotroph\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heterotroph\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eats<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plants<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">or<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">animals<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.425\" font-size=\"6.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Lion<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"66.125\" font-size=\"6.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">(heterotroph)<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Energy<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">from<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">that<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">food<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that cannot make its own food and eats other organisms.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>异养生物<\/b>：不能自己制造食物，必须以其他生物为食的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">hetero- = other. Fed by other things.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">hetero- = 其他：靠别的东西喂养。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Are animals autotrophs or heterotrophs?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Heterotrophs.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u1.t.family", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A rank below order, made up of related genera.”<\/i>", "opts": ["stimulus", "phylum", "family", "ecosystem"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>family<\/b>: A rank below order, made up of related genera. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">科<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.bacteria", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A domain of single-celled prokaryotes with no nucleus, found almost everywhere.”<\/i>", "opts": ["domain", "Bacteria", "phylum", "organ system"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>Bacteria<\/b>: A domain of single-celled prokaryotes with no nucleus, found almost everywhere. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细菌域<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.archaea", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A domain of single-celled prokaryotes that look like bacteria but are chemically different; many live in extreme places.”<\/i>", "opts": ["Archaea", "levels of organization", "autotroph", "dichotomous key"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>Archaea<\/b>: A domain of single-celled prokaryotes that look like bacteria but are chemically different; many live in extreme places. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">古菌域<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.eukarya", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The domain of organisms whose cells have a nucleus: protists, fungi, plants and animals.”<\/i>", "opts": ["heterotroph", "ecosystem", "multicellular", "Eukarya"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>Eukarya<\/b>: The domain of organisms whose cells have a nucleus: protists, fungi, plants and animals. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">真核域<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.prokaryote", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A cell or organism with no nucleus. Its DNA floats free inside the cell.”<\/i>", "opts": ["six-kingdom system", "prokaryote", "tissue", "derived characteristic"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>prokaryote<\/b>: A cell or organism with no nucleus. Its DNA floats free inside the cell. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">原核生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.eukaryote", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A cell or organism whose DNA is inside a nucleus.”<\/i>", "opts": ["eukaryote", "kingdom", "tissue", "levels of organization"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>eukaryote<\/b>: A cell or organism whose DNA is inside a nucleus. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">真核生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.autotroph", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that makes its own food, usually using light energy.”<\/i>", "opts": ["phylogeny", "Archaea", "autotroph", "reproduction"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>autotroph<\/b>: An organism that makes its own food, usually using light energy. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">自养生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.heterotroph", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that cannot make its own food and eats other organisms.”<\/i>", "opts": ["six-kingdom system", "stimulus", "heterotroph", "three-domain system"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>heterotroph<\/b>: An organism that cannot make its own food and eats other organisms. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">异养生物<\/span>", "whys": null}]}